%Name = "Avenue"
%MapFile = "Avenue.map"

%LevelBriefing = "SCALPEL AVENUE

Welcome to your first mission. This won't be easy, trust me, so pause the game and read carefully.

a.) There's a shortage of doctors to hire here, luckily I managed to scout a couple of pros for you. 
Make sure you keep them happy and running.

b.) Focus on creating a surgical wing; a little birdy told me buttcheek implants are a booming trend in this region.

c.) Don't worry too much about reputation, your focus needs to be on curing as many people as you can with this limited space, and 
making a big profit.

Good luck."

%LevelDebriefing = "Impressive! You managed to do a whole lot with so little. Ready for your next challenge? Say your goodbyes here, 
pack some Vicodin and diapers and let's move on."

